 &lt;a href="https://blog.usablenet.com/digital-accessibility-lawsuits-in-2026-five-trends-companies-should-know" title="" class="hs-featured-image-link"&gt; &lt;img src="https://blog.usablenet.com/hubfs/Digital%20Accessibility%20Lawsuits%20in%202026_%20Five%20Trends%20Companies%20Should%20know.png" alt="Digital Accessibility Lawsuits in 2026: Five Trends Companies Should Know" class="hs-featured-image" style="width:auto !important; max-width:50%; float:left; margin:0 15px 15px 0;"&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Digital accessibility lawsuits are on pace to reach another record in 2026. But the total number of cases is only part of the story.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="hs-featured-image-wrapper"&gt; 
