&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;Once a search returns dozens of flights, filters are how a traveler narrows the list, unless the filter controls lock a screen reader out. These are the filter barriers to check for on your own site. Second in Michael Taylor's five-part series on airline booking accessibility.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
